    "id": "madas/alevel-applied-v/q7",
    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-v/q7-question-1.svg\" alt=\"At “Stavros Restaurant” the owner is told by his chef that 25% of the customers order vegetarian food. The owner wants to check the validity of the chef’s assertion so he checks a random sample of 20 orders, only to find 2 vegetarian orders. a) Is there evidence, at the 10% level of significance, that the proportion of vegetarian orders is lower than 25%? ( ) 6 At “Mavros Restaurant” the owner is told by his waiters that 25% of the customers order vegetarian food. The owner wants to check the validity of the waiters’ belief so he checks a random sample of 100 orders. b) Given that there are 31 vegetarian orders in the sample, use a distributional approximation, to test at the 5% level of significance, the belief of the waiters at “Mavros Restaurant”. ( ) 8\" style=\"--madas-width:577.3px\"></figure><figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-v/q7-question-2.svg\" alt=\"Question diagram\" style=\"--madas-width:581.3px\"></figure>",
    "steps": [
      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-v/q7-solution-1.svg\" alt=\"(a) Test H0 : p = 0.25 [B1] [A1] against H1 : p &lt; 0.25. [A1] For X ∼B(20, 0.25), P(X ≤2) ≈0.09126 &lt; 0.10. [A1] Reject H0. [A1] There is evidence that the vegetarian share at Stavros is below 25% . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-v/q7-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"(b) Test H0 : p = 0.25 [B1] [A1] against H1 : p̸ = 0.25 at Mavros: [A1] Approximate the null count by Y ∼N(25, 18.75). [A1] For 100 meals under the null, np = 25, np(1 −p) = 18.75. The observation 31 leads to a normal boundary of 30.5, with standard score √ 5.5/ 18.75 = 1.2702 . . . . The upper-tail probability with continuity correction is √ 1 −Φ((30.5 −25)/ 18.75) ≈0.1020. [A1] This exceeds the 0.025 upper-tail limit. [A1] Fail to reject H0. [A1] There is insufficient evidence that the share at Mavros differs from 25% . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:678.7px\"></figure>",
      "<p class=\"madas-total\">Total mark for question 7 is 14 marks.</p>"
    ],
